{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「粵艇南下」今日起實施，首批有五艘遊艇來港。<br/></p><p>首批「粵艇」中午約12時駛入大嶼山遊艇會，有遊艇掛上「首航」的橫幅。署理財政司司長黃偉綸、運物局局長陳美寶等官員，在場迎接首批遊客。</p><p></p><p>來港的「粵艇」，可在本港五個分別位於大潭灣、淺水灣、西貢、大澳及赤柱的錨泊區停泊，共有115個指定泊位。「粵艇」留港期間，海事處會透過系統動態監察去向，若駛入限制區會發出通知。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.YACHT-1230_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ykftk5efMh1792127111.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T05:39:21.375282+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T04:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T05:37:47.727105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T05:37:47.727105+00:00","content_hash":"e23f79c3fedfe065158776292c2b8e35f50b8c1c8b0a3191a83c80ff698f1226","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}